Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.59,0:03:02.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不相信存在灵魂伴侣  很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Why?  Well, last night, I met Monica's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了  昨晚我遇到了莫妮卡的灵魂伴侣
