Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:12.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had a date with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:12.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我约会的那个男人
