Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, don't be crazy. You don't think there's somebody out there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别犯傻了  你不觉得会有人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:20.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}better suited for Monica than me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:20.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比我更适合莫妮卡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what's he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他长什么样子
