Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:29.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他很高  棕发  当然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A tall guy with hair similar to mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个发色跟我一样的高大男人
