Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他从事跟食物相关的行业
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:37.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sure. Older?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  年纪比较大吗
