Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:39.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  他是英国人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.27,0:03:41.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I was just gonna ask!  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.27,0:03:41.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正打算要问你  是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he's so centered, and mature and confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他非常聪明  成熟  有自信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.11,0:03:48.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's so sad they never had a chance to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.11,0:03:48.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真可惜他们彼此不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.61,0:03:52.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Luckily, the guy she settled for can't hear what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.61,0:03:52.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好她老公没听到你说这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm so sorry. Maybe I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  我可能搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:59.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna go out with him again. I'll find out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:59.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会再跟他约会  对他进一步了解
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:01.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You believe that this guy is destined for someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:01.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你明明觉得他跟别人是天生一对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:02.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you're still gonna date him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:02.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还要跟他约会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:06.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He may not be my soul mate, but a girl's gotta eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:06.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽说他不是我的灵魂伴侣  但我总得吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.41,0:04:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just talked to Joey. I wanted to see you how you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.41,0:04:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚跟乔伊谈过  我想知道你好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:20.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still can't believe it. Joey and Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:20.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是不敢相信  乔伊跟瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:24.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like you and me going out, only weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:24.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像是你跟我交往  只不过更奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:27.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you're hurting, and I want to be supportive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:27.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你很难过  我也想安慰你...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:29.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but don't say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:29.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但别再说那种话了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:33.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my god. What if they get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:33.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们要是结婚了怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:35.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'd be the stepfather of my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:35.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他可能做我孩子的继父
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, I don't think that's something we need to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你不必担心这种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:41.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}First of all, he'll never tell her how he feels about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:41.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不会把自己的感觉告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And even if he did, you have no idea how she'd react.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算他说了 你也不知道她会有什么反应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:47.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, women never like Joey. I think he's a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:47.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女人从来就不喜欢乔伊  我觉得他还是处男
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:53.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Joey isn't even thinking about going after Rachel.  He's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:53.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他根本就没想过要追瑞秋  真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:56.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, all he's thinking about is how you're taking this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:56.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  他关心的是你对此事的反应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, it's completely freaking him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这件事把他吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's talking about moving to Vermont.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他甚至想搬到佛蒙特州去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:05.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Why?  He says he wants to leave the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:05.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么  他想离开这个国家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He thinks you hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他觉得你恨他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:14.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hate him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:14.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恨他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:17.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:17.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我不恨他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:23.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just, it's Rachel. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:23.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那可是瑞秋  你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't even imagine how hard this must be for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我无法想像你有多难过...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I don't want you to lose Joey over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不希望你跟乔伊因此做不成朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right now, he just needs to know that you're still his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:36.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在他想知道你是不是还把他当朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我会跟他谈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最好快去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:48.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He just asked me how to convert his dollars into Vermont money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:48.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他刚刚问我怎么把美金换成佛蒙特货币
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:00.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Chandler, Monica, this is Don.  Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:00.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒  莫妮卡  他是唐  你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:02.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:02.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好  幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:04.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} How are you?  Soul mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:04.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好吗  灵魂伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:08.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what have you guys been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:08.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们刚才有什么活动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we just had a terrible lunch today at Adriatica.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在艾德瑞提卡吃了顿难以下咽的午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's with the sundried tomatoes in that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那家餐厅的番茄干是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:16.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know! Is this 1985?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:16.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是  难道现在还是1985年吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:19.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's exactly what I said. Phoebe, isn't that strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:19.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是那么说的  菲比  这很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.15,0:06:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.15,0:06:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点都不会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:23.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong with sundried tomatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}番茄干怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On a barbecuedchicken pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}洒在烤鸡披萨上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Don. What other restaurants do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唐  你还喜欢哪家餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Octavio. 27and7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}奥克塔维欧  27与7
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's this great little place, Alessandro's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有亚利山多洛斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! That's my restaurant, I'm the chef there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  我是那里的主厨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.32,0:06:43.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding me! Your food is fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.32,0:06:43.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开玩笑吧  你做的菜好吃极了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really want to talk about your menu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要跟你谈谈你的菜单
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:47.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}once I get some coffees first. Um, anyone want any?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:47.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我先去买杯咖啡  还有人要喝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'd like a latte.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要喝拿铁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? If you're gonna talk about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你要谈我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:55.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:55.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这是要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. I swear to god, I didn't know you guys would be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我发誓我不知道你们在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:02.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the good news is you don't even believe in soul mates, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:02.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好你不相信灵魂伴侣  所以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:05.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe in tall, handsome strangers who hit on my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:05.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我相信英俊的陌生人要追我老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:07.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're just talking, and you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:07.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们不过是聊天而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:08.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just because I think they're soul mates
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:08.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算我认为他们是灵魂伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}doesn't mean anything'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那也不代表会发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe? Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's great. I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他太棒了  我爱他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:21.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry, we'll find you someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:21.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心  我们会帮你再找个老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand if you came by to hit me. I deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你是来打我的  我能理解  这是我活该
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:41.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't want to hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我不想打你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:44.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, then? Kick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:44.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么  你要踢我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.26,0:07:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bite me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.26,0:07:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}咬我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:52.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want to do anything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想对你怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:55.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just want to tell you that I'm not mad at you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:55.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想告诉你  我没有生你的气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:59.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and that I certainly do not hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:59.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然也不恨你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just came here to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是来告诉你这些
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, wait, Ross, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下  罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.31,0:08:10.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wanna come in for a beer or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.31,0:08:10.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想进来喝瓶啤酒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:15.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:15.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got any beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你带啤酒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I got is melon stuff that Rachel left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只有瑞秋留下的香瓜饮料
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:41.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, Ross. You need to understand something, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:41.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  有件事你得知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:42.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:42.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:49.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am never gonna act on this Rachel thing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:49.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我绝不会对瑞秋采取行动  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:53.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wouldn't do anything to jeopardize my friendship with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:53.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会做出任何会危及你我友谊的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:17.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, it'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:17.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之  我只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:21.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'll take me a while to get over her, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:21.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得花点时间去淡忘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:23.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not even sure how to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:23.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不确定我该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:25.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean I've never been in love before, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:25.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以前从没陷入过爱河  所以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.61,0:09:32.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're in love with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.61,0:09:32.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你爱上她了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:37.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Yeah. I thought you knew that.  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:37.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我以为你知道  不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.99,0:09:41.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, if it helps,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.99,0:09:41.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着  如果有帮助的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want to feel this way, honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的也不希望自己有那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:45.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just keep thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:45.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是一直在想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I'll get over this," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"我得忘了这件事"  你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it just keeps getting harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我越努力就越忘不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:57.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what to do, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:57.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:59.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't... What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:59.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:09.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you need to tell her how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:09.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你该告诉她你的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, that's the green stuff talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定是被这饮料冲昏了头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.59,0:10:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm serious. You need to find out where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.59,0:10:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是认真的  你得知道她的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because if she's not where you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}then you can start to move past this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:22.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就可以放下了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But what if, and I'm not saying she will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但如果...  我不是说她会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.97,0:10:28.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she is where you are, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.97,0:10:28.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她喜欢你...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then my feeling weird shouldn't stand in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我的感受不该妨碍到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Are you sure?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定  对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:43.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, if she's gonna end up with somebody else...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她要跟别的男人在一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:46.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the truth is, she couldn't find a better guy, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:46.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的  她找不到更好的人选了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So when do you think you're gonna talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你准备什么时候要跟她谈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:55.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. I have to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:55.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  我得跟她谈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:11:00.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I haven't thought about what I will say. What should I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:11:00.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还没有想过  我该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:03.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm understanding, but let's not get carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:03.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能体谅你  但不要太过激动了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.78,0:11:09.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What am I gonna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.78,0:11:09.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:15.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:15.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也觉得超难喝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:32.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I've been slowly phasing out the wine importing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:32.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我逐渐放弃了红酒进口的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:35.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and focusing more on the cheese side of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:35.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在全力研究奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:36.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cheese, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:36.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说奶酪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:40.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's some pretty smelly work, huh, Don?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:40.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这研究起来可真够臭气熏天的  唐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Excuse me?  Cheese. It's smelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  奶酪很臭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You must smell a lot of the time too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定也经常臭气四溢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:53.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not really. But when it comes to cheese,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:53.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会的  但我觉得奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:55.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm one of the people who thinks the smellier, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:55.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}越臭越好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.97,0:11:58.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too! Chandler can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.97,0:11:58.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是  钱德勒就受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:01.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He won't even allow me to have blue cheese in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:01.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他都不让我在家吃蓝纹奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:02.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you're still married to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:02.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你还嫁给了他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what I'd love to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道我想干嘛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:14.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would like to go to France and eat nothing but bread and cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:14.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想去法国  只吃面包跟奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not even bread. Just cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甚至连面包都不吃  只要奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:18.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I want the bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:18.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我要面包
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:20.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And pastries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:20.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有油酥饼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:22.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And pate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:22.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟小蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm really not high. It's just I used to be fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我并不是真的兴奋  只是以前我很胖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:30.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well if you where ever enter the Loire valley let me know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:30.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在罗亚尔谷有栋别墅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:32.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got a great little villa you can stay at.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:32.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你如果去法国可以住在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it made of cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是用奶酪做的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. A house made of cheese, wouldn't that be incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  不过用奶酪做的房子  简直宛如天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:43.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I'd move in tomorrow!  Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:43.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我明天就想搬进去  少来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:48.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Are you listening to this!  I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:48.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你听到了吗  对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:49.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What do we do?  I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:49.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们该怎么办  我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:51.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They both want to live in a house of cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:51.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们都想住在奶酪屋里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.26,0:12:54.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know how you fight that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.26,0:12:54.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道你该拿什么去抗争
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:04.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay. I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:04.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can tell her how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以告诉她我的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, stand up straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  挺直腰杆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take a couple deep breaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.23,0:13:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.23,0:13:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}表现出自信
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:26.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just came by because I want to talk to you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:26.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来找你  是想告诉你一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, in the hall? What are we, animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就在走廊上谈  我们是畜生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:34.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm late for a meeting. Could you make it quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:34.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我开会要迟到了  你能快点说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:38.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just came by to tell you that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:38.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是来告诉你...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I want to have dinner with you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今天想跟你一起吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:44.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure. That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:44.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just leave me a message and tell me where to meet you. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我留言  告诉我到哪里找你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  这样也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.59,0:13:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, that give you a couple hours
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.59,0:13:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这又给你几小时的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:55.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to prepare what you're gonna say. Good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:55.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准备好谈话内容  不错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.78,0:13:57.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you people ever knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.78,0:13:57.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们就不会敲门吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:01.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd like to have Don and Phoebe over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:01.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想请唐跟菲比过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wouldn't that be nice?  Sure. Why don't you set it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不错吧  没问题  你去安排吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll just be over here browsing through the personals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就坐着看看征婚广告
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you okay? You're acting weird all afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没事吧  你有点怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:13.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Fine. Not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:13.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事  算不上心情大好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:15.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:15.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但也很不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:18.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jeez, what's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:18.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, did you say "cheese"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  你刚刚说"奶酪"吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:24.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:24.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:27.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe thinks you and Don are soul mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:27.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比说你跟唐是灵魂伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.43,0:14:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't believe in that kind of stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.43,0:14:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不迷信那种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:30.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but then you two totally get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:30.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你们两个一拍即合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:33.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, look, I won't stand in your way if you wanna run off with Don
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:33.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你想跟唐住在奶酪屋里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and live in a house of cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以退出
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.49,0:14:38.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, you don't believe in soul mates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.49,0:14:38.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒  你不相信灵魂伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:40.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but I'm sure "tomahtoes" does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:40.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  但我相信"番茄干先生"相信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't believe in soul mates, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不相信灵魂伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:47.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You don't?  Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:47.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不相信吗  对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think you and I were destined to end up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得我们并非注定要在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:54.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think that we fell in love and work hard at our relationship.
